      "behavior": "SuperTuxKart's profile race of supertuxkart.args in the small form, four AI karts on the hacienda track for 10 s of the race's time, drawn fullscreen at 640x400 under a headless Weston on Mesa's llvmpipe, runs to its profile summary, and the time of each frame is recorded",
